      "label": "American flag",
      "description": "The national flag of the United States of America, a symbol of American identity, patriotism, and government. Its use in the meme, combined with the altered text, is intended to falsely associate the celebration with Puerto Rico, a U.S. territory, and to mock or trivialize the cultural significance of Cinco de Mayo by implying a connection to American culture or politics.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
