      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_fc4aed21",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The meme is designed to target a general online audience familiar with cultural holidays and internet humor, particularly those who may not be aware of the cultural significance of Cinco de Mayo or the specific sensitivities around Puerto Rican identity. The humor relies on the audience recognizing the misspelling and the visual juxtaposition of the American flag with the altered holiday name, implying a mocking or satirical intent. The target audience likely includes individuals who find cultural misrepresentation or parody amusing, even if it is insensitive or offensive to others. The meme does not target a specific demographic group but rather appeals to a broad audience that engages with internet memes and may not be deeply familiar with the cultural nuances of the referenced holidays or territories.",
